# Repository cleanup policy
# Keep source, docs, report PDFs, report sources, examples, and config templates.
# Keep local datasets, generated pipeline artifacts, caches, models, and secrets out of Git.

# Project data roots copied to Drive
data/*
Phase_1/data/*
Phase_2/data/*
!data/README.md
!Phase_1/data/README.md
!Phase_2/data/README.md

# Raw/generated data folders anywhere in the repo
**/input/
**/output/
**/outputs/
**/result/
**/results/
**/.work/
**/work/
**/test_parsing/
**/ms_marco_val/
